Package: sendmailanalyzer
Architecture: all
Depends: perl, passwd, acl, util-linux, systemd, tar, gzip, libdbi-perl, libdbd-sqlite3-perl, libplack-perl, liburi-perl
Conflicts: sendmailanalyzer10
Replaces: sendmailanalyzer10
Recommends: apache2, rsyslog
Description: modern Postfix-first mail log analyzer and web dashboard
 SendmailAnalyzer 10 correlates Postfix, Postscreen, SpamAssassin, native
 Rspamd file logs, OpenDKIM, OpenDMARC, ClamAV and Dovecot events into SQLite.
 It provides a read-only web dashboard, JSON API and Prometheus-style metrics.
 This package is the production successor to SendmailAnalyzer 9.4 and also
 replaces the temporary sendmailanalyzer10 packages used during v10 testing.
